.TH geectl-remote-release-project 1  "geectl-remote-release-project 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-release\-project \- Release a whole project\*(Aqs sources and binaries. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the release. A release to a target project needs a repository and a target repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote release\-project\fR [\fB\-\-repository\fR] [\fB\-\-arch\fR] [\fB\-\-target\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-target\-repository\fR] [\fB\-\-set\-release\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-delay\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Release a whole project\*(Aqs sources and binaries. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the release. A release to a target project needs a repository and a target repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repository\fR \fI<REPOSITORY>\fR
Release only binaries from this repository
.TP
\fB\-\-arch\fR \fI<ARCH>\fR
Release only binaries for this architecture
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-project\fR \fI<TARGET_PROJECT>\fR
Release only to this project
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-repository\fR \fI<TARGET_REPOSITORY>\fR
Release only to this repository in the target project
.TP
\fB\-\-set\-release\fR \fI<SET_RELEASE>\fR
Rename binaries during the release using this release tag
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-delay\fR
Run the release immediately instead of queueing it as a job
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to release
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
